:"https://github.com/DarkHat28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkHat28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T09:29:37Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T09:29:37Z","body":"## Bug Report: Godot 4.4.1 Performance Drop (Android and PC)\n### Tested Versions\n- **Mobile**: Godot 4.4 (good) vs. 4.4.1 (bad)\n- **PC**: No difference Noticeable (on medium-range PC)\n### What Happens\n- **Mobile**: Godot 4.4.1 runs slower on medium-range Android phones (e.g. Vivo Y20g).\n- **PC**: No noticeable change (tested on Ryzen 5 5600T/RX 580/32GB RAM).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095905013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3099663525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105313#issuecomment-3099663525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105313","id":3099663525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64wRyl","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T22:34:07Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T22:34:53Z","body":"@DarkHat28 Can you upload a minimal reproduction project to reproduce the issue? I haven't been able to reproduce any particular performance regression between 4.4 and 4.4.1 specifically, both on desktop and mobile.\n\nPS: When doing testing on a mobile device, keep in mind that thermal throttling can be an issue. This is less likely to be the case in a 2D project, but it's not impossible that it will affect results. Try waiting 20 minutes between each test to make sure thermal throttling is not an issue, and limit each test's duration to 2 minutes or so.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3099663525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191240909","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105313#issuecomment-3191240909","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105313","id":3191240909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-NnjN","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar